<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.claim.takes ~ takeover ~ a claim passes to this holder

`lares intent takeover <claim-cid>` signs a takeover of the named claim, referencing it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ takeover

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`takeover` params=`target/<claim-cid> ~ take the claim over`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ target · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`target` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/1 as/<target> ~ the claim's cid`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose intent plane this reads or writes, a whole persona index from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/face-atom ~ signs under the face's own atom key through the store door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-malformed · face-not-held · claim-cid-absent

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ an unknown sub-verb, or no sub-verb named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-malformed` params=`~ --face names a whole persona index from 0`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-held` params=`~ this vessel holds no such face`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`claim-cid-absent` params=`~ name the claim's cid`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ cid

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`cid` params=`exit/0 ~ the signed entry's cid prints`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares intent takeover

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares intent takeover]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

